Hi Kamontip,

Unfortunately, Amelia, along with almost all multiple imputation software,
requires the data be MAR. In general, if the data is MNAR, you will have to
build an application-specific model that incorporates specific assumptions
about the missing data mechanism.

Cheers,
matt.

~~~~~~~~~~~
